        "kind": "method",
        "explain": "Implemented __get__ (the two earlier entries are overloads). If obj is None (class access) returns the descriptor itself; otherwise reads obj.config[self.__name__], applies get_converter when set, and returns the result. Exceptions from mapping access or conversion propagate.",
        "summary": "Reads the descriptor's key from obj.config, optionally converting the value.",
